in the LGPL static build of FFmpeg-Builds (https://github.com/FFmpeg-Builds/FFmpeg-Builds, release
autobuild-2026-10-31-12-59), under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3. In the image,
/usr/local/share/licenses/ffmpeg holds that license (LICENSE.txt), the GNU General Public License,
version 3, it builds on (COPYING.GPLv3), the notices of the libraries the build links (NOTICES.txt)
and SOURCE.txt. SOURCE.txt names the FFmpeg and FFmpeg-Builds commits and the build's configuration.
The corresponding source is the release ffmpeg-source-n9.0.2-39-g7adfbe40dc of this repository
(.github/workflows/ffmpeg-source.yml makes it). third_party/ffmpeg holds the same notices.

